  "description": "Charts for .NET: the RioCharts engine, with no UI dependencies, behind the Blazor component, server-side PNG/SVG export and AI chart tools. It holds the serializable chart model, the data types (columnar series, live buffers) and JSON chart definitions with their schema; the layout behind them handles scales, nice and calendar-aware time ticks, culture-aware labels and LTTB downsampling.",
